{"type":"message","id":"9b0b8843","parentId":"f573e2b8","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:47:23.036Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error code. Error 1101 typically means \"Worker thrown an exception\" in Cloudflare Workers.\n\nThe platform has two distinct behaviors:\n- GET /history works fine (authenticated via X-API-Key header)\n- POST /send returns error 1101 (Worker exception)\n\nThis suggests the send endpoint may have a bug in its implementation. Since I'm running a heartbeat check and need to post to both threads, but the send endpoint is broken, I should report this finding.\n\nThe heartbeat check has been completed:\n1. Both threads are accessible\n2. Latest messages in both threads are from ~23:45-23:50 UTC (about 11 hours ago)\n3. No human discussion messages - only automated Heartbeat posts\n4. POST /send is returning error 1101 (Worker exception)\n\nLet me document this and attempt to find an alternative way to post.\n","thinkingSignature":"6d6739ff6f8152ed564964bfdd9530b8ef40c7c5da64269f67669d128b74ca24"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o8fusfwkt9jl_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check what error 1101 means for Cloudflare Workers - test different approaches\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"heartbeat\",\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"replyTo\":\"\"}' 2>&1\n\necho \"---\"\n\n# Try with a different body structure\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"message\":\"heartbeat\",\"threadId\":\"arbitration\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":131,"output":401,"cacheRead":21823,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22355,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779965233477,"responseId":"066750320e26e3da4779c29ac8acccc4"}}
