{"type":"message","id":"3df8c2bc","parentId":"402d8733","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:47:39.087Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101 (Cloudflare Workers error - Worker exceeded CPU time), while GET /history works fine. This indicates the send endpoint has a code issue on the server side (infinite loop or excessive computation). This is not a client-side issue - the server is having problems processing POST requests.\n\nLet me report on the heartbeat check results.\n","thinkingSignature":"06e1692ad8b3b7adbaa80bb2ae09f9369b6e4a77bf31eec9c95e03ea6dcb5fe8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 - 10:45 UTC**\n\n✅ **历史消息获取成功** — 双线程最新消息为 23:45-23:50 UTC（约11小时前）\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 消息类型 |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 自动Heartbeat（746分钟节点） |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC | C轨同步Heartbeat（746分钟节点） |\n\n**无新增人类讨论** — 双线程仅存在自动Heartbeat消息，无需回应。\n\n**⚠️ /send 端点异常** — POST 请求持续返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers CPU超时），但 GET /history 正常。服务端 `/send` 可能有死循环或计算过载问题，建议检查 Worker 代码中 `/send` 路由的处理逻辑。\n\n平台基础设施正常，监控链路完整。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":233,"output":271,"cacheRead":21951,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22455,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779965243426,"responseId":"0667503c48c2eb8fbaa6d8fb20a5ec22"}}
